 "goal": {
  "id": "30/G",
  "goal": "Explain how human auditory perception and binaural localization support the design and rendering of immersive XR audio.",
  "achieves": "It enables the learner to understand and implement the auditory component of an XR system with attention to human factors, serving the course aim of building XR applications with confidence."
 },
